Package: ufs-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, dkms, linux-headers-generic | linux-headers-$(uname -r)
Description: UFS (Universal Filesystem) kernel module - DKMS source
 UFS is a cross-platform filesystem designed for Windows, Linux, macOS, and UEFI.
 It features Metadata Capsules for lossless cross-platform metadata preservation,
 logical redo journaling, per-extent compression (LZ4/ZSTD), and dual-layer
 integrity (CRC32C metadata + BLAKE3 data).
 .
 This package contains the DKMS source for building the UFS kernel module
 automatically for each installed kernel.